{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.62, "text": "In this town, the richer you are, the higher your house is."}, {"start": 3.82, "end": 7.94, "text": "You see, poor people live all the way down here, in tiny wooden houses."}, {"start": 8.48, "end": 12.48, "text": "People with a little more money live on small towers, maybe 10 floors high."}, {"start": 12.9, "end": 14.64, "text": "Then, you have the rich families."}, {"start": 15.1, "end": 17.62, "text": "Their houses are hundreds of floors above the ground,"}, {"start": 17.9, "end": 21.32, "text": "with giant pools, basketball courts, and private elevators."}, {"start": 21.7, "end": 22.42, "text": "But the billionaires?"}, {"start": 23.08, "end": 27.06, "text": "Huh, their houses are so high, they literally reach outer space."}, {"start": 27.06, "end": 30.14, "text": "Some even have swimming pools floating next to the moon."}, {"start": 30.74, "end": 31.06, "text": "And me?"}, {"start": 31.58, "end": 33.14, "text": "Well, this is my house."}, {"start": 33.6, "end": 36.22, "text": "A tiny wooden box, right next to the garbage dump."}, {"start": 36.84, "end": 40.16, "text": "Every morning, I watch rich kids take private elevators to school,"}, {"start": 40.52, "end": 43.66, "text": "while I have to climb a broken ladder just to reach the sidewalk."}, {"start": 44.32, "end": 46.3, "text": "My best friend lives on floor 200."}, {"start": 46.82, "end": 50.92, "text": "He has his own basketball court, a giant pool, and even a pet dinosaur."}, {"start": 51.6, "end": 53.18, "text": "Last week, he invited me over."}, {"start": 53.18, "end": 57.34, "text": "But the security guard took one look at my clothes and kicked me out."}, {"start": 58.08, "end": 60.6, "text": "Apparently, ground-level people aren't allowed above the clouds."}, {"start": 61.38, "end": 63.04, "text": "But everything changed one morning."}, {"start": 63.48, "end": 65.4, "text": "I woke up to a massive earthquake."}, {"start": 65.78, "end": 66.86, "text": "The ground was shaking."}, {"start": 67.24, "end": 68.14, "text": "People were screaming."}, {"start": 68.62, "end": 69.86, "text": "And then, boom!"}, {"start": 70.46, "end": 73.78, "text": "A gigantic golden mansion fell straight out of the sky,"}, {"start": 74.14, "end": 76.26, "text": "right into the empty lot next to my house."}, {"start": 76.98, "end": 79.76, "text": "Golden walls, diamond windows, and a swimming pool"}, {"start": 79.76, "end": 81.48, "text": "bigger than my entire neighborhood."}, {"start": 81.48, "end": 83.8, "text": "Thousands of people gathered around it,"}, {"start": 84.0, "end": 85.72, "text": "but nobody dared to go inside."}, {"start": 86.48, "end": 88.04, "text": "Then, I noticed something strange."}, {"start": 88.64, "end": 91.44, "text": "A little golden key was lying right in front of my door."}, {"start": 91.96, "end": 95.54, "text": "I picked it up, and suddenly, the mansion's front doors opened."}, {"start": 95.94, "end": 99.08, "text": "A giant screen turned on, and a robotic voice said,"}, {"start": 99.52, "end": 100.9, "text": "new owner identified."}, {"start": 101.5, "end": 103.86, "text": "My face appeared on every screen in the city."}, {"start": 104.22, "end": 106.36, "text": "Even the billionaires in space could see me."}, {"start": 106.74, "end": 109.38, "text": "Then, the voice said something that made everyone freeze."}, {"start": 109.94, "end": 112.7, "text": "Warning, the previous owner did not fall."}, {"start": 113.16, "end": 114.04, "text": "He was pushed."}, {"start": 114.66, "end": 117.14, "text": "And suddenly, every mansion above the clouds"}, {"start": 117.14, "end": 119.2, "text": "started moving, straight toward me."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.38}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.1, "e": 1.16}, {"w": "richer", "s": 1.16, "e": 1.38}, {"w": "you", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.62}, {"w": "are,", "s": 1.62, "e": 1.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.18, 